{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31499","headline":"穆天子 · 李羣玉","name":"穆天子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆满恣逸志，而轻天下君。\n一朝得八骏，逐日西溟濆。\n寂漠崦嵫幽，绝迹留空文。\n三千閟宫艳，怨绝宁胜云。\n或言帝轩辕，乘龙凌紫氛。\n桥山葬弓劒，暧昧竟难分。\n不思五弦琴，作歌咏南薰。\n但听西王母，瑶池吟白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}